<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Stackdrop - Install Multiple Apps at Once</title>
    <meta name="description" content="The easiest, fastest way to install software. Stackdrop downloads and installs programs automatically in the background.">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/favicon.png">
    <script async src="https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-5191967343616615"
     crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
    <link href="https://ninite.com/static/css/bootstrap.min-ce67dc5fdca0309111ecf0491515e7a7.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://ninite.com/static/css/ninite-08d598403b81d71f0982c129e7ba63b4.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        .homepage-app-label {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 8px;
            margin: 2px 0;
            border-radius: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.2s;
        }
        .homepage-app-label:hover {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
        }
        .homepage-app-label input[type="checkbox"] {
            margin-right: 8px;
        }
        .homepage-app-label img {
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            margin-right: 8px;
        }
        .homepage-app-section {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .homepage-app-section h4 {
            color: #333;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #0066cc;
        }
        .btn-primary {
            background-color: #4CAF50;
            border-color: #4CAF50;
        }
        .btn-primary:hover {
            background-color: #009e3f;
            border-color: #009e3f;
        }
        .btn-primary:disabled {
            background-color: #ccc;
            border-color: #ccc;
            cursor: not-allowed;
        }
        .navbar-brand {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #0066cc !important;
        }
        .homepage-introduction {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 40px 0;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .homepage-introduction h4 {
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .alert-warning {
            background-color: #fff3cd;
            border-color: #ffeaa7;
            color: #856404;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="ninite-canvas">

<nav class="navbar navbar-default navbar-static-top">
<div class="container">
<div class="navbar-header">
<button type="button" class="navbar-toggle collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-target=".js-navbar-collapse" aria-expanded="false">
<span class="sr-only">Toggle navigation</span>
<span class="icon-bar"></span>
<span class="icon-bar"></span>
<span class="icon-bar"></span>
</button>
<a class="navbar-brand" href="/">
Stackdrop.It
</a>
</div>
<div class="collapse navbar-collapse js-navbar-collapse">
<ul class="nav navbar-nav navbar-right">
<li><a href="/help/">Help</a></li>
<li><a href="/feedback">Feedback</a></li>
<li><a href="/StackdropPro">Feedback</a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</nav>

<div class="homepage-introduction">
<div class="container">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-sm-6">
<h4>Install and Update All Your Programs at Once</h4>
<p>
No clicking next, next, next. No junk. Just pick your apps and go.
</p>
<p>
<img src="/images/image.png" alt="Stackdrop Screenshot" class="img-responsive img-rounded">
</p>
<div class="alert alert-warning">
<p><strong>New!</strong> Stackdrop now generates small, fast downloader EXEs that automatically download and install your selected applications. No more huge files!</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col-sm-3">
<h4>🔄 Latest Updates</h4>
<p>Our system scans the internet every day for the latest versions of your apps and puts them all here for you!</p>
<p>
Chrome updated to latest version.<br>
<span class="small">July 13, 2025</span>
</p>
<p>
Firefox updated to latest version.<br>
<span class="small">May 29, 2025</span>
</p>
<p>
VLC updated to 3.0.20.<br>
<span class="small">May 29, 2025</span>
</p>
<p>
AnyDesk updated to latest version.<br>
<span class="small">May 29, 2025</span>
</p>
<p>
CCleaner updated to latest version.<br>
<span class="small">May 29, 2025</span>
</p>
<p>
Spotify updated to latest version.<br>
<span class="small">May 29, 2025</span>
</p>
<p>
Zoom updated to latest version.<br>
<span class="small">May 29, 2025</span>
</p>
<p>
Opera (needs manual update)<br>
<span class="small">Last auto-update: June 2, 2025</span>
</p>
</div>
<div class="col-sm-3">
<h4>Fast and always up to date installers</h4>
<p>
Stackdrop generates small downloader EXEs that automatically fetch the latest versions from our server and install them silently.
</p>
<p>
The system supports:
</p>
<ul>
<li>Web Browsers</li>
<li>Media Players</li>
<li>Security Tools</li>
<li>Development Tools</li>
<li>And much more!</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<form method="post" action="/generate-installer">
<div class="container">
<h3 class="text-center">1. Pick the apps you want then...</h3>
</div>
<div>
<ul class="list-unstyled center-block js-masonry" data-masonry-options='{"isFitWidth": true}'>

<% Object.keys(apps).forEach(function(category) { %>
<li class="homepage-app-section">
<h4><%= apps[category].title %></h4>
<ul class="list-unstyled">
<% apps[category].items.forEach(function(app) { %>
<li>
<label for="cb_<%= app.id %>" class="homepage-app-label" title="<%= app.name %>">
<input type="checkbox" class="js-homepage-app-checkbox" name="apps" value="<%= app.id %>" id="cb_<%= app.id %>">
<% if (app.id.includes('chrome')) { %>
<i class="fab fa-chrome" style="color: #4285f4; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('firefox')) { %>
<i class="fab fa-firefox-browser" style="color: #ff7139; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('edge')) { %>
<i class="fab fa-edge" style="color: #0078d4; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('opera')) { %>
<i class="fab fa-opera" style="color: #ff1b2d; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('zoom')) { %>
<i class="fas fa-video" style="color: #2d8cff; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('discord')) { %>
<i class="fab fa-discord" style="color: #5865f2; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('teams')) { %>
<i class="fab fa-microsoft" style="color: #6264a7; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('skype')) { %>
<i class="fab fa-skype" style="color: #00aff0; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('slack')) { %>
<i class="fab fa-slack" style="color: #4a154b; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('itunes')) { %>
<i class="fab fa-apple" style="color: #000000; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('vlc')) { %>
<i class="fas fa-play" style="color: #ff8800; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('aimp')) { %>
<i class="fas fa-music" style="color: #ff6b35; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('foobar2000')) { %>
<i class="fas fa-music" style="color: #ff6b35; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('winamp')) { %>
<i class="fas fa-music" style="color: #f93822; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('musicbee')) { %>
<i class="fas fa-music" style="color: #ff6b35; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('audacity')) { %>
<i class="fas fa-microphone" style="color: #0000cc; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('klitecodecs')) { %>
<i class="fas fa-film" style="color: #ff6b35; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('gom')) { %>
<i class="fas fa-play" style="color: #ff8800; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('spotify')) { %>
<i class="fab fa-spotify" style="color: #1db954; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('cccp')) { %>
<i class="fas fa-film" style="color: #ff6b35; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('mediamonkey')) { %>
<i class="fas fa-music" style="color: #ff6b35; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('handbrake')) { %>
<i class="fas fa-film" style="color: #ff6b35; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('malwarebytes')) { %>
<i class="fas fa-shield-alt" style="color: #ff6b35; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('avast')) { %>
<i class="fas fa-shield-alt" style="color: #ff6b35; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('avg')) { %>
<i class="fas fa-shield-alt" style="color: #ff6b35; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('spybot2')) { %>
<i class="fas fa-shield-alt" style="color: #ff6b35; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('avira')) { %>
<i class="fas fa-shield-alt" style="color: #ff6b35; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('superantispyware')) { %>
<i class="fas fa-shield-alt" style="color: #ff6b35; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('dropbox')) { %>
<i class="fab fa-dropbox" style="color: #0061ff; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('googledrive')) { %>
<i class="fab fa-google-drive" style="color: #4285f4; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('onedrive')) { %>
<i class="fab fa-microsoft" style="color: #0078d4; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('ccleaner')) { %>
<i class="fas fa-broom" style="color: #ff6b35; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('teamviewer')) { %>
<i class="fas fa-desktop" style="color: #0e8ee9; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('anydesk')) { %>
<i class="fas fa-desktop" style="color: #ff6b35; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('imgburn')) { %>
<i class="fas fa-compact-disc" style="color: #ff6b35; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('notepadplusplus')) { %>
<i class="fas fa-edit" style="color: #90ee90; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('filezilla')) { %>
<i class="fas fa-server" style="color: #bf0000; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('vscode')) { %>
<i class="fas fa-code" style="color: #007acc; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('dotnet')) { %>
<i class="fab fa-microsoft" style="color: #512bd4; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('jdk') || app.id.includes('java')) { %>
<i class="fab fa-java" style="color: #ed8b00; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else if (app.id.includes('python')) { %>
<i class="fab fa-python" style="color: #3776ab; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } else { %>
<i class="fas fa-cog" style="color: #666; font-size: 16px;"></i>
<% } %>
<%= app.name %>
</label>
</li>
<% }); %>
</ul>
</li>
<% }); %>

</ul>
</div>
<div class="container">
<h3 class="text-center">2. Click here to Get your Stackdrop installer</h3>
<p class="text-center text-danger hidden js-homepage-no-apps">
Please check off the apps you want above.
</p>
<p class="text-center">
<button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg js-homepage-get-installer" accesskey="g" id="generate-btn-top">Get Your Stackdrop Installer</button>
</p>
<p class="text-center">
<small>Stackdrop works on Windows 11, 10, 8.x, 7, and equivalent Server versions.</small>
</p>
</div>
</form>

<div class="container">
<hr>
</div>

<div class="container">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-sm-6">
<h4>Stackdrop will</h4>
<ul>
<li>start working as soon as you run it</li>
<li>not bother you with any choices or options</li>
<li>install apps in their default location</li>
<li>say no to toolbars or extra junk</li>
<li>install 64-bit apps on 64-bit machines</li>
<li>install apps in your PC's language</li>
<li>do all its work in the background</li>
<li>install the latest stable version of an app</li>
<li>skip up-to-date apps</li>
<li>skip any reboot requests from installers</li>
<li>download apps from each publisher's official site</li>
<li>verify digital signatures or hashes before running anything</li>
<li>work best if you turn off any web filters or firewalls</li>
<li>save you a lot of time!</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="col-sm-6">
<h4>About Stackdrop</h4>
<p>
Stackdrop generates silent installers for Windows applications, making deployment easy and efficient.
</p>
<p>
Our system supports a wide range of applications including:
</p>
<ul>
<li>Web Browsers (Chrome, Firefox, Edge, Opera)</li>
<li>Media Players (VLC, iTunes, Spotify)</li>
<li>Security Tools (Malwarebytes, Avast, AVG)</li>
<li>Development Tools (Visual Studio Code, Python, Java)</li>
<li>And many more!</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>

</div>

<div class="footer">
<div class="container text-center">
<ul class="list-inline">
<li><a class="footer-link" href="/about">about</a></li>
<li><a class="footer-link" href="/help">help</a></li>
<li><a class="footer-link" href="/feedback">feedback</a></li>
</ul>
<p class="small">
&copy; Stackdrop - Silent Installer Generator
</p>
</div>
</div>

<script src="https://ninite.com/static/js/jquery-3.6.4.min-9663b61e980ed29d7a6ce3726c3714e6.js"></script>
<script src="https://ninite.com/static/js/collapse-efe73e03e8fffec0dacb5abe412f4d78.js"></script>
<script src="https://ninite.com/static/js/dropdown-54e9cfe90f65ad9a867ff67615ccac74.js"></script>
